[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 243.27, "timestamp": "00:04:03", "text": "大家好，早上好！ 你好。 你好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 244.869, "timestamp": "00:04:04", "text": "哎呀，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 246.39, "timestamp": "00:04:06", "text": "今天嗓子哑了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 250.47, "timestamp": "00:04:10", "text": "你好。 呃，我们有个机器人。 让我来扮演"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 254.149, "timestamp": "00:04:14", "text": "这个人吧。   我勒个去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 260.027, "timestamp": "00:04:20", "text": "？ 让它消失吧。  [哼]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 261.27, "timestamp": "00:04:21", "text": "[清嗓子]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 264.07, "timestamp": "00:04:24", "text": "大家好。 所以今天我们要演奏的是《"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 265.99, "timestamp": "00:04:25", "text": "凋零之波》。 我已经很久没玩"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 269.189, "timestamp": "00:04:29", "text": "这个游戏了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 272.87, "timestamp": "00:04:32", "text": "所以，我很兴奋能尝试一下[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 276.07, "timestamp": "00:04:36", "text": "，当然，只是因为……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 279.749, "timestamp": "00:04:39", "text": "嗯，这次有个特别的合作，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 284.23, "timestamp": "00:04:44", "text": "而且故事也很好，嗯，自从游戏发售后动画也上映以来，我就一直是《"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 287.11, "timestamp": "00:04:47", "text": "赛博朋克2077》的忠实粉丝"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 294.31, "timestamp": "00:04:54", "text": "。 我想我以前也在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 297.189, "timestamp": "00:04:57", "text": "直播中玩过这款游戏"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 298.95, "timestamp": "00:04:58", "text": "。"}]